
>> countries := ሰልፍ አዲስ
	~ ['Switzerland']
	~ ['Italy']
	~ ['Germany'].

>> foods := ሰልፍ አዲስ
	~ ['Rösti']
	~ ['Spaghetti']
	~ ['Sauerkraut'].


>> counter := 0.
foods መሠረት: countries, እያንዳንዱ: { :key :value
	counter ደምር: 1.
}.

ውጤት ፃፍ: (['we serve counter dishes'] counter: counter), አዲስ-መስመር.

>> counter := 42.
['TrytosortthiswithoutsegfaultingButActualNumberDe✎dsOnOS'] ቁምፊዎች ደርድር: { :v
	counter ደምር: 0.
}.

ውጤት ፃፍ: (['we sort counter dishes'] counter: counter), አዲስ-መስመር.


>> counter := 0.
{
	{
		counter ደምር: 1.
	} × (3 + 1 + 1 × 0.5).
} × 100.


ውጤት ፃፍ: (['we calculate counter numbers.'] counter: counter), አዲስ-መስመር.

